WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.800
Working in crocodile country takes more than luck.
We protect your crew with six lines of defence.

00:08.300 --> 00:15.300
One: capture and relocation. Our last resort,
when a crocodile can't be managed in place.

00:16.300 --> 00:21.600
Two: safety overwatch.
Trained eyes on the water while your crew works.

00:24.300 --> 00:30.300
Three: fauna spotter catchers,
moving snakes and wildlife out of harm's way.

00:32.300 --> 00:37.300
Four: feral animal management,
across the land around your site.

00:40.300 --> 00:45.600
Five: awareness training,
so every worker knows the risk.

00:48.300 --> 00:55.700
Six: wildlife consulting, the procedures
that hold it all together. Crocodile Safety Australia.

00:56.800 --> 01:00.500
Call us on 0409 326 307.
